+# PW-D05: Audiobookshelf Browser Onboarding Contract
+
+## Status
+
+Accepted
+
+## Context
+
+PW-I12 implements the first unauthenticated smoke tests for Audiobookshelf.
+Before service-level tests can be written, the exact user journeys, stable
+selectors, controlled test data, and runtime prerequisites must be pinned.
+
+## Decision
+
+Define the Audiobookshelf 2.35.1 browser onboarding contract as follows.
+
+### User Journeys
+
+| Journey | Priority | Auth Required | PW Issue |
+|---------|----------|---------------|----------|
+| HTTPS endpoint reachable (HTTP 200) | P0 | No | PW-I12 |
+| Login page renders with SSO button | P0 | No | PW-I12 |
+| OIDC login completes, library loads | P0 | Yes | PW-I13 |
+| Library list visible | P1 | Yes | PW-I12 |
+| Logout terminates session | P1 | Yes | PW-I13 |
+| Playback starts (audio file) | P2 | Yes | PW-I16 |
+| Admin settings page accessible | P2 | Admin role | PW-I15 |
+
+### Stable Selectors
+
+| Element | Selector | Stability |
+|---------|----------|-----------|
+| Main content area | `[role="main"]` | High (ARIA) |
+| Navigation sidebar | `[role="navigation"]` | High (ARIA) |
+| Library list | `[data-testid="library-list"], ul[aria-label="Library"]` | Medium |
+| Keycloak login button | `getByRole("button", { name: /keycloak\|log in with keycloak/i })` | Medium |
+| Logout link | `getByRole("link", { name: /logout/i })` | Medium |
+
+### Runtime Prerequisites
+
+| Prerequisite | Check | On Failure |
+|--------------|-------|------------|
+| DNS resolves | `audiobookshelf.hl.maier.wtf` → A record | `prerequisite_error` |
+| TLS valid | HTTPS GET → valid cert | `prerequisite_error` |
+| Service healthy | `GET /` → HTTP 200 | `prerequisite_error` |
+| Keycloak reachable | OIDC discovery endpoint valid | `prerequisite_error` |
+| Frontproxy configured | HTTPS → HTTP proxy to ABS | `prerequisite_error` |
+
+### Controlled Test Data
+
+- No controlled media required for unauthenticated smoke (PW-I12)
+- Library should contain at least one audiobook for authenticated playback tests (PW-I16)
+- Test data is not provisioned by Playwright tests; operator provides the runtime environment
+
+## Consequences
+
+- PW-I12 can proceed with unauthenticated checks using only the stable selectors above
+- PW-I13 and later issues use the same selectors and journey definitions
+- Selector changes in ABS require updating this contract and all dependent specs
+- No Audiobookshelf-specific logic enters shared fixtures (PWR-074)
